Package: baxters-power-goo
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Baxter <baxter@localhost>
Installed-Size: 512
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-numpy, python3-pil, python3-pyqt6, python3-scipy, xclip | wl-clipboard
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Description: Baxters Power Goo — image deformation tool
 Apply goo-style warp and deformation effects to images.
 Supports PNG, JPEG, BMP, TIFF input. Clipboard paste via xclip or wl-paste.
